<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN FINAL SCORE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN FINAL SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in the unfinished Hong</p>
<p>Kong Open men's tennis final on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) leads 5-Patrick Rafter (Australia) 6-3</p>
<p>5-3, interrupted by rain, match resumes on Monday.</p>
